Here is the concise Dos and Don'ts Cheat Sheet for Safe AI Use. 🛡️

✅ THE DOS
DO check privacy settings: Turn off "data training" if you want to keep your chats private.
DO fact-check everything: AI can confidently give wrong answers (hallucinations). Verify important info.
DO use AI as a helper, not the boss: Let it do drafts and summaries, but you review the final work.
DO keep a human in charge: For high-stakes decisions (health, money, law), a human must make the final call.

❌ THE DON'TS
DON'T share Personal Data: Never type passwords, bank details, addresses, or medical records.
DON'T paste Confidential Work Info: Never share company secrets, unreleased plans, or customer lists.
DON'T blindly trust the AI: Avoid overreliance. AI predicts patterns; it doesn't "know" fact.
DON'T assume AI is unbiased: It learns from human data, so it can copy unfair stereotypes.

